-- 主要：透视 / 无限体力 / 速度控制 | 防护：096 / 035 / 173 / 口袋透视 | 攻击：自动射击 / 自动技能
-- 判定只认权威字段(Class/Controller/Role/SCP/Team/Tags)，不靠昵称
-- 口袋透视：门后打到真实房间=真(绿)，打到 Abyss 或未命中=假(红)

local G = getgenv()
print("[ESP] v16.18 已启动 · 三栏 UI · 透视/防护/攻击 · 精简版")
local PlayersSvc = game:GetService("Players")
local P = PlayersSvc.LocalPlayer
local WS = game:GetService("Workspace")
local RUS = game:GetService("RunService")

local RED   = Color3.fromRGB(255, 85, 85)
local GREEN = Color3.fromRGB(70, 225, 120)
local GUNC  = Color3.fromRGB(95, 210, 255)
local CRATEC = Color3.fromRGB(70, 225, 120)

local HEAVY = Enum.Font.GothamBold
pcall(function() HEAVY = Enum.Font.GothamBlack end)
